---
title: Apple Torte
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@egg{1}
@sugar{1%cup}
@flour{1%cup}
@baking powder{1%tsp}
@almond extract{0.5%tsp}
@chopped apple{1%cup}
@chopped nuts{0.5%cup}

Bake in 8x8 pan at 350 degrees until brown. Serve warm and top with whipped cream.
